<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-TOUR OF CATALONIA FIRST STAGE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF CATALONIA FIRST STAGE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>VILA SECA, Spain 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the</p>
<p>two-leg first stage of the Tour of Catalonia on Thursday:</p>
<p>First leg, over 72 kms from Vila Seca to La Pineda</p>
<p> 1. Jan Svorada (Slovakia)   1 hour 57 minutes 23 seconds</p>
<p>2. Federico Colonna (Italy)</p>
<p>3. Federic Moncassin (France)</p>
<p>4. Enrico Cassani (Italy)</p>
<p>5. Jeremy Hunt (Britain)</p>
<p>6. Massimo Strazzer (Italy)</p>
<p>7. Sergei Outschakov (Ukraine)</p>
<p>8. Angel Edo (Spain)</p>
<p>9. Marco Bellini (Italy)</p>
<p> 10.Igor Flores (Spain)     all same time</p>
<p>Second leg, a time-trial over 8 kms from Port Aventura to La</p>
<p>Pineda</p>
<p>1. Chris Boardman (Britain)  8 minutes 42 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Angel Luis Casero (Spain)	 12 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Aitor Garmendia (Spain)	   same time</p>
<p> 4. Fernando Escartin (Spain)	 23</p>
<p> 5. Stuart O'Grady (Australia)	32</p>
